hadiths[47]{hadithnumber,text}:
"493","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdul Malik bin Umair se, Abdur Rahman bin Saeed se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Salman ke sath tha aur unhon ne Kinda me ek mareez ki iyadat ki, phir jab woh us ke pas dakhil hue to farmaya: Khushkhabri pao, pas beshak momin ki bimari ko Allah us ke liye kaffara aur itab ka zariya banata hai, aur beshak fajir ki bimari us oont ki tarah hai jise us ke ghar walon ne bandh diya phir use chhor diya, pas woh nahin janta ke use kyun bandha gaya aur kyun chhora gaya."
"494","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Adi bin Adi ne humen khabar di, Abu Salama se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Momin mard aur momin aurat par bala hamesha rehti hai, us ke jism me aur us ke ahl me aur us ke maal me, yahan tak ke woh Allah Azza wa Jalla se is haal me milta hai ke us par koi khataya nahin hoti. Muhammad bin Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Talha ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Amr se unhi ki tarah aur unhon ne us ki aulad me izafa kiya."
"495","Ahmad bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salama se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati aaya to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tujhe Umm Mildam ne pakra hai, us ne kaha: Umm Mildam kya hai, Aap ne farmaya: Khal aur gosht ke darmiyan garmi, us ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: Kya kabhi tujhe suda hua hai, us ne kaha: Suda kya hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ek hawa hai jo sar me aariz hoti hai, jo ragon ko thonkti hai, us ne kaha: Nahin, phir jab woh khara hua to Aap ne farmaya: Jise khushi ho ke woh aag walon me se ek mard ko dekhe yani pas use chahiye ke ise dekhe."
"496","Imran bin Maisara ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Fuzail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain ne hum se bayan kiya, Shaqiq bin Salama se, Khalid bin Rabi se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Huzaifa par marz bhari ho gaya to un ke khandan aur Ansar ne is ki khabar suni, pas woh un ke pas aadhi raat me ya subah ke qareeb aaye, unhon ne farmaya: Ye kaun si ghari hai, hum ne kaha: Aadhi raat hai ya subah ka waqt hai, unhon ne farmaya: Main aag ki subah se Allah ki panah mangta hun, unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum woh cheez laye ho jis me mujhe kafan diya jaye, hum ne kaha: Ji han, unhon ne farmaya: Kafanon me mubaligha na karo, pas beshak agar Allah ke han mere liye bhalai hai to mujhe us ke badle us se behtar diya jayega, aur agar dusri surat hui to mujh se bahut jald cheen liya jayega. Ibn Idris ne kaha ke hum raat ke ek hisse me un ke pas aaye."
"497","Ibrahim bin Munzir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa bin Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Zib se, Jubair bin Abi Salih se, Ibn Shihab se, Urwa se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab momin bimar hota hai to Allah use khalis kar deta hai jaise bhatti lohe ke mail ko khalis kar deti hai."
"498","Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne humen khabar di, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Urwa ne bayan kiya, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahin jo kisi musibat me mubtala ho, dard ya marz me, magar woh us ke gunahon ka kaffara hoti hai, yahan tak ke kanta jo use chubhta hai ya thokar."
"499","Makki ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Juaid bin Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Aisha bint Saad se, ke un ke walid ne kaha: Maine Makkah me sakht bimari ki shikayat ki, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam meri iyadat ke liye tashreef laye, to maine kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, main maal chhorta hun, aur maine ek beti ke siwa koi aulad nahin chhori, to kya main apne maal ke do tihaee ki wasiyyat kar dun aur ek tihaee chhor dun, Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, unhon ne kaha: Kya main aadhe ki wasiyyat kar dun aur us ke liye aadha chhor dun, Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, unhon ne kaha: To kya main tihaee ki wasiyyat kar dun aur us ke liye do tihaee chhor dun, Aap ne farmaya: Tihaee karo, aur tihaee bhi bahut hai, phir Aap ne apna hath meri peshani par rakha, phir mere chehre aur pet par phera, phir farmaya: Ya Allah Saad ko shifa ata farma aur us ki hijrat ko us ke liye mukammal farma, pas main apne jigar par Aap ke hath ki thandak pata raha is gumaan me jo mujhe hota tha ab tak."
"500","Qabisa bin Uqba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Alqama bin Marsad se, Qasim bin Mukhaimira se, Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Koi shakhs nahin jo bimar hota hai magar us ke liye us amal jaisa likha jata hai jo woh tandrusti me karta tha."
"501","Arim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sinan Abu Rabia ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Anas bin Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahin jise Allah us ke jism me aazmaish me dale magar us ke liye woh likha jata hai jo woh apni tandrusti me karta tha, jab tak woh bimar raha, phir agar Allah use afiyat de to mera khayal hai ke unhon ne kaha ke use asal ata karta hai, aur agar use qabz kar le to use bakhsh deta hai. Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Yanam se, Ani se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhi ki tarah aur izafa kiya ke unhon ne farmaya pas agar use shifa de to use asal ata karta hai."
"502","Qurra bin Habib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Iyas bin Abi Tamima ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata bin Abi Rabah se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Bukhar Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe apne nazdeek apne sab se mehboob ghar walon ki taraf bhej, to Aap ne use Ansar ki taraf bheja, pas woh un par chhe din aur un ki raaton tak raha, to ye un par sakht guzra, pas Aap un ke gharon me un ke pas tashreef laye, to unhon ne is ki shikayat Aap se ki, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ghar ba ghar aur makan ba makan dakhil hone lage, un ke liye afiyat ki dua karte hue, phir jab Aap wapas hue to un me se ek aurat Aap ke peeche aayi aur kaha: Qasam us ki jis ne Aap ko haq ke sath bheja beshak main Ansar me se hun, aur beshak mere walid Ansar me se hain, pas mere liye Allah se dua karein jaise Aap ne Ansar ke liye dua ki, Aap ne farmaya: Jo tu chahe, agar tu chahe to main Allah se dua karun ke woh tujhe afiyat de, aur agar tu chahe to sabar kar aur tere liye Jannat hai, us ne kaha: Balke main sabar karungi aur Jannat ko khatre me nahin dalungi."
"503","Aur Ata se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Koi marz nahin jo mujhe lahiq ho jo mujhe bukhar se zyada mehboob ho, kyunke woh mere har uzw me dakhil hota hai, aur beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla har uzw ko ajr me se us ka hissa deta hai."
"504","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Aamash se, Abu Wail se, Abu Nuhaila se, un se kaha gaya: Allah se dua karo, unhon ne kaha: Ya Allah marz me kami kar aur ajr me kami na kar, to un se kaha gaya: Dua karo, dua karo. To unhon ne kaha: Ya Allah mujhe muqarrabeen me se bana de aur meri walida ko hoor e een me se bana de."
"505","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Imran bin Muslim Abu Bakr se, unhon ne kaha: Ata bin Abi Rabah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne mujh se kaha: Kya main tumhen ahl e jannat me se ek aurat na dikhaun, main ne kaha: Haan kyun nahin, unhon ne kaha: Ye siyah aurat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aayi to us ne kaha: Mujhe mirgi aati hai aur mera satar khul jata hai, pas Allah se mere liye dua kijiye, Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to sabar karo aur tumhare liye jannat hai, aur agar tum chaho to main Allah se dua karun ke Wo tumhen aafiyat de, to us ne kaha: Main sabar karungi, phir us ne kaha: Mera satar khul jata hai, pas Allah se mere liye dua kijiye ke mera satar na khule, to Aap ne us ke liye dua ki."
"506","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Umm Zufar ko dekha, wohi aurat, Kaabe ki seedhi par lambi siyah faam thi, unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe Abdullah bin Abi Mulaika ne khabar di ke Qasim ne unhen khabar di ke Aisha ne unhen khabar di ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmaya karte the: Momin ko jo kaanta lage ya us se zyada takleef pahunche to wo us ke liye kaffara hai."
"507","Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Mauhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere chacha Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Mauhab ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Duniya me jo musalman kaanta chubhne par sawab ki ummid rakhe to qayamat ke din us ke zariye us ke gunahon me se kami ki jayegi."
"508","Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sufyan ne mujh se bayan kiya, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Koi momin mard ya momin aurat, ya musalman mard ya musalman aurat aisa nahin jo kisi marz me mubtala ho magar Allah us ke sabab us ke gunahon me se kami kar deta hai."
"509","Zakariya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usama ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Abdullah bin Zubair Asma ke paas gaye, Abdullah ke qatl se das raaten pehle, aur Asma takleef me thin, to Abdullah ne un se kaha: Tum apne aap ko kaisa paati ho, unhon ne kaha: Takleef me, unhon ne kaha: Main maut me hun, to unhon ne kaha: Shayad tum meri maut chahte ho, isi liye us ki tamanna karte ho, pas aisa na karo, Allah ki qasam main marna pasand nahin karti yahan tak ke mujh par tumhare do anjamon me se ek guzre, ya to tum qatl kiye jao to main tum par sawab ki ummid rakhun, ya tum ghalib aao to meri aankh thandi ho, pas khabardar tumhare samne koi tajweez pesh ki jaye jo tumhare mawafiq na ho to tum maut ki nafrat se use qubool kar lo, aur Ibn Zubair ki muraad ye thi ke wo qatl kiye jayenge to is se unhen gham pahunchega."
"510","Ahmad bin Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Hisham bin Saad ne khabar di, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, Abu Saeed Khudri se, ke wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaye jabke Aap ko bukhar tha, Aap par ek chadar thi, to unhon ne Aap par haath rakha to chadar ke upar se hi us ki hararat mehsoos ki, to Abu Saeed ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah aap ka bukhar kitna sakht hai, Aap ne farmaya: Hum aise hi hain, hum par bala sakht aati hai aur hamare liye ajar dugna kar diya jata hai, to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah logon me sab se zyada sakht bala kis par aati hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ambiya par, phir nek logon par, aur un me se ek faqr me mubtala hota tha yahan tak ke siwa ek aba ke kuch na pata jise wo kaat kar pehenta tha, aur juon me mubtala hota tha yahan tak ke wo use halak kar detin, aur un me se ek bala par is se zyada khush hota tha jitna tum me se koi ataa par khush hota hai."
"511","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Munkadir se, unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Main bimar para to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam meri iyadat ke liye tashreef laye aur Abu Bakr bhi aur wo dono paidal the, to unhon ne mujhe behosh paya, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne wuzu kiya phir apna wuzu ka pani mujh par bahaya to mujhe hosh aa gaya to samne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam the, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah main apne maal me kya karun, apne maal ka kya faisla karun, to Aap ne mujhe kisi cheez ka jawab na diya yahan tak ke meeras ki aayat nazil hui."
"512","Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim Ahwal se, Abu Usman Nahdi se, Usama bin Zaid se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki sahabzadi ka ek bachcha marz me bhari ho gaya to us ki walida ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf qasid bheja ke mera beta maut ke qareeb hai, to Aap ne qasid se farmaya: Jao aur us se kaho: Beshak Allah hi ka hai jo Us ne liya aur Usi ka hai jo Us ne diya, aur har cheez Us ke paas muqarrar waqt tak hai, pas use chahiye ke sabar kare aur sawab ki ummid rakhe, to qasid wapas gaya aur use khabar di, to us ne Aap ki taraf qasid bheja Aap ko qasam dete hue ke Aap zaroor tashreef layen, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam chand sahaba ke humrah khade hue, un me Saad bin Ubada bhi the, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne bachche ko pakda aur use apne seene ke darmiyan rakha, aur us ke seene se kharkharahat ki awaz nikal rahi thi jaise purani mashk ke kharkharane ki awaz hoti hai, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki dono aankhon se aansu beh nikle, to Saad ne kaha: Kya aap rote hain jabke aap Allah ke Rasool hain, to Aap ne farmaya: Main sirf us par reham karte hue ro raha hun, beshak Allah apne bandon me se sirf reham karne walon par reham karta hai."
"513","Hasan bin Waqi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Damra ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Abi Abla se, unhon ne kaha: Meri biwi bimar hui to main Umm Darda ke paas aata to wo mujh se kehtin: Tumhare ghar wale kaise hain, to main un se kehta: Bimar hain, to wo mere liye khana mangwatin to main khata, phir main wapas gaya to unhon ne aisa hi kiya, phir ek martaba main un ke paas aaya to unhon ne kaha: Kya haal hai, main ne kaha: Wo theek hone lage hain, to unhon ne kaha: Main tumhare liye is liye khana mangwati thi ke tum hamen apne ghar walon ke bare me khabar dete the ke wo bimar hain, pas jab wo theek hone lage hain to hum tumhare liye kisi cheez ka intezam nahin karenge."
"514","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahhab Saqafi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid Hazza ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek dehati ki iyadat ke liye us ke paas tashreef le gaye to farmaya: Tum par koi harj nahin, InshaAllah ye paak karne wala hai, unhon ne kaha: Dehati ne kaha: Balke ye bukhar hai jo ek buddhe par josh maar raha hai taake use qabron tak pahuncha de, Aap ne farmaya: Phir haan aisa hi ho."
"515","Muhammad bin Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan bin Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Kaisan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Aaj subah tum me se kaun rozedar hai, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Main, Aap ne farmaya: Aaj tum me se kis ne mareez ki iyadat ki, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Main, Aap ne farmaya: Aaj tum me se kaun janaze me sharik hua, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Main, Aap ne farmaya: Aaj kis ne miskin ko khana khilaya, Abu Bakr ne kaha: Main, Marwan ne kaha: Mujhe ye baat pahunchi ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jis aadmi me ek din me ye khaslaten jama ho jayen wo jannat me dakhil hota hai."
"516","Ahmad bin Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shababa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Mughira bin Muslim ne bayan kiya, Abu Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Umm Saib ke paas tashreef laye jabke wo kaanp rahi thin, to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhen kya hua, us ne kaha: Bukhar hai, Allah use ruswa kare, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Thahro, use bura na kaho, beshak ye momin ke gunahon ko is tarah door karta hai jaise bhatti lohe ke zang ko door karti hai."
"517","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Nadr bin Shumail ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamein Hammad bin Salama ne khabar di, Sabit al-Bunani se, Abu Rafi se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhon ne farmaya: Allah farmata hai: Main ne tujh se khana manga to tu ne Mujhe khilaya nahin, unhon ne farmaya: to wo kahega: Ai mere Rabb, Tu ne mujh se khana kaise manga jabke main ne Tujhe khilaya nahin aur Tu to Rabb al-Alamin hai, unhon ne farmaya: Kya tujhe maloom nahin ke Mere falan bande ne tujh se khana manga to tu ne use nahin khilaya, kya tujhe maloom nahin ke agar tu use khilata to tu usko Mere paas pata, Ai Adam ke bete, Main ne tujh se pani manga to tu ne Mujhe nahin pilaya, to us ne kaha: Ai mere Rabb, main Tujhe kaise pilaun jabke Tu Rabb al-Alamin hai, to Wo farmata hai: Mere falan bande ne tujh se pani manga to tu ne use nahin pilaya, kya tujhe maloom nahin ke agar tu use pilata to tu usko Mere paas pata, Ai Adam ke bete, Main bimar hua to tu ne Meri ayadat nahin ki, unhon ne kaha: Ai mere Rabb, main Teri ayadat kaise karun jabke Tu Rabb al-Alamin hai, unhon ne farmaya: Kya tujhe maloom nahin ke Mera falan banda bimar hua, to agar tu uski ayadat karta to tu usko Mere paas pata, ya tu Mujhe uske paas pata."
"518","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Aban bin Yazid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Qatada ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Abu Isa al-Uswari ne bayan kiya, Abu Saeed se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhon ne farmaya: Bimar ki ayadat karo, aur janazon ke peeche chalo, wo tumhein akhirat yaad dilayenge."
"519","Malik bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Awana ne bayan kiya, Umar bin Abi Salama se, unke walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se unhon ne farmaya: Teen cheezen hain woh sab har Musalman par haq hain: bimar ki ayadat, janaze me haziri, aur chheenkne wale ko Yarhamukallah kehna jab woh Allah azza wa jalla ki hamd kare."
"520","Muhammad bin al-Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdul Wahhab ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ayyub ne bayan kiya, Amr bin Saeed se, Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se unhon ne kaha: mujh se Bani Saad ke teen afraad ne bayan kiya, woh sab apne walid se bayan karte the ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Makkah me Saad ke paas ayadat ke liye dakhil hue, to woh ro pade, to unhon ne farmaya: Tujhe kya rulata hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe darr hai ke main usi zameen me mar jaun jis se main ne hijrat ki hai jaisa Saad mara, unhon ne kaha: Ai Allah Saad ko shifa de, teen martaba, to unhon ne kaha: Mere paas bahut maal hai, meri do betiyan meri waris hongi, to kya main apne sare maal ki wasiyat kar dun, unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, unhon ne kaha: To do tihaai ki, unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, unhon ne kaha: To aadhe ki, unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, unhon ne kaha: To tihaai ki, unhon ne farmaya: Tihaai, aur tihaai bahut hai, beshak tere maal se tera sadqa sadqa hai, aur tere ghar walon par tera kharch sadqa hai, aur jo teri biwi tere khane me se khaye woh tere liye sadqa hai, aur beshak tu apne ghar walon ko khair par, ya unhon ne kaha: aasoodgi par chhode, yeh is se behtar hai ke tu unhein logon se mangte hue chhode, aur unhon ne apne hath se ishara kiya."
"521","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdul Wahid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Asim ne bayan kiya, Abu Qilaba se, Abu al-Ashas al-Sanani se, Abu Asma se unhon ne kaha: Jo apne bhai ki ayadat kare woh Jannat ki khurfa me hota hai, main ne Abu Qilaba se kaha: Jannat ki khurfa kya hai, unhon ne kaha: Uska phal, main ne Abu Qilaba se kaha: Abu Asma ne yeh kisse bayan kiya tha, unhon ne kaha: Sauban se, Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se isi tarah."
"522","Qais bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Khalid bin al-Haris ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdul Hamid bin Jafar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe mere walid ne khabar di ke Abu Bakr bin Hazm aur Muhammad bin al-Munkadir, masjid walon me se kuch logon ke sath, Umar bin al-Hakam bin Rafi al-Ansari ki ayadat ke liye aaye, unhon ne kaha: Ai Abu Hafs, hamein hadees bayan karo, unhon ne kaha: main ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo bimar ki ayadat kare woh rehmat me dakhil hota hai, yahan tak ke jab baith jata hai to usme jam jata hai."
"523","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Amr se, Ata se unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ne Ibn Safwan ki ayadat ki, phir namaz ka waqt aa gaya, to Ibn Umar ne unhein do rakaten parhayin, aur kaha: Hum safar me hain."
"524","Sulaiman bin Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se ke Yahud me se ek ladka Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki khidmat karta tha, to woh bimar hua, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam uske paas uski ayadat ke liye aaye, to uske sar ke paas baithe phir farmaya: Islam le aa, to us ne apne walid ki taraf dekha, jabke woh uske sar ke paas tha, to unhon ne us se kaha: Abul Qasim sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki itaat kar, to woh Musalman ho gaya, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bahar nikle jabke woh farma rahe the: Sab tareef Allah ke liye hai Jis ne use aag se bachaya."
"525","Ismail bin Abi Uwais ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Malik ne bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwa se, unke walid se, Aisha se unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Madina tashreef laye to Abu Bakr aur Bilal bimar ho gaye, unhon ne kaha: To main un dono ke paas dakhil hui, main ne kaha: Ai mere abba, aap apne aap ko kaisa pate hain, aur ai Bilal, tum apne aap ko kaisa pate ho, unhon ne kaha: Aur Abu Bakr jab unhein bukhar pakadta to kehte: Har shakhs apne ghar walon me subah karta hai, aur maut uski juti ke tasme se zyada qareeb hai, aur Bilal jab un se bukhar utarta to apni awaz buland karke kehte: Kaash mujhe maloom hota kya main ek raat wadi me guzarunga jabke mere ird gird izkhir aur jalil ho, aur kya main kabhi Majinna ke paniyon par utrunga, aur kya Shamah aur Tafil mujhe nazar ayenge, unhon ne kaha: Aisha ne kaha: To main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aayi phir unhein khabar di, to unhon ne farmaya: Ai Allah Madina ko humare liye mehboob bana de jaise Makkah ki humari muhabbat ya us se zyada shadid, aur use sehatmand bana, aur humare liye uske saa aur uske mudd me barkat de, aur uske bukhar ko muntaqil karke Juhfa me kar de."
"526","Mualla ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdul Aziz bin al-Mukhtar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Khalid ne bayan kiya, Ikrima se, Ibn Abbas se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek dehati ke paas ayadat ke liye dakhil hue, unhon ne kaha: Aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab bimar ke paas ayadat ke liye dakhil hote to farmate: Koi harj nahin, Insha Allah pakizgi hai, unhon ne kaha: Yeh pakizgi hai, hargiz nahin balke yeh bukhar hai jo ek buddhe shakhs par josh marta hai, ya bhadakta hai, use qabron tak pahunchayega, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: To phir han aisa hi hai."
"527","Ahmad bin Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdullah bin Wahb ne bayan kiya, Harmala se, Muhammad bin Ali al-Qurashi se, Nafi se unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar jab bimar ke paas dakhil hote to us se puchte: Woh kaisa hai, phir jab uske paas se uthte to kehte: Allah tere liye khair muqaddar kare, aur us par izafa nahin karte the."
"528","Ahmad bin Yaqub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ishaq bin Saeed bin Amr bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, apne walid se unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj Ibn Umar ke paas dakhil hua, aur main unke paas tha, to us ne kaha: Woh kaisa hai, unhon ne kaha: Achha hai, us ne kaha: Tumhein kis ne mara, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us ne mara jis ne hathyar uthane ka hukm diya aise din me jis me uska uthana halal nahin, yani Hajjaj."
"529","Saeed bin Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bakr bin Mudar ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Zahr ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hibban bin Abi Jabalah se, woh Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Sharab peene walon ki ayadat na karo jab woh beemar hon."
"530","Zakariya bin Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hakam bin Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waleed jo Ibn Muslim hain unhon ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Haris bin Ubaidullah Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Umm Darda ko dekha ke un ke kajave par lakdiyan thin jin par koi poshish na thi is haal me ke woh masjid walon me se Ansar ke ek mard ki ayadat kar rahi thin."
"531","Ali bin Hujr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Mushir ne humein Ajlah se khabar di, woh Abdullah bin Abi al-Huzail se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood ek mareez ke paas us ki ayadat ke liye dakhil hue aur un ke sath kuch log the aur ghar me ek aurat thi to qaum me se ek mard us aurat ko dekhne laga to Hazrat Abdullah ne us se kaha: Agar teri aankh phoot jati to ye tere liye behtar hota."
"532","Abdurrahman bin Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salm bin Qutaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus bin Abi Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam ko kehte hue suna: Meri aankh dukhne lagi to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne meri ayadat ki phir farmaya: Ae Zaid agar teri aankh ka woh haal ho jo is me hai to tu kya karega, unhon ne kaha: Main sabr karunga aur sawab ki umeed rakhunga, farmaya: Agar teri aankh ka woh haal ho jo is me hai phir tu sabr kare aur sawab ki umeed rakhe to tera sawab Jannat hoga."
"533","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, woh Qasim bin Muhammad se, ke Muhammad ke sahaba me se ek mard ki beenai chali gai to logon ne us ki ayadat ki to us ne kaha: Main in dono aankhon se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko dekhna chahta tha ab jab ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam wafaat pa gae to Allah ki qasam mujhe ye khush nahi karta ke in me jo takleef hai woh Tabala ke hirnon me se kisi hiran ke sath bhi ho."
"534","Abdullah bin Salih aur Ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Lais ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin al-Had ne mujh se bayan kiya, Amr maula Muttalib se, woh Hazrat Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah Azza wa Jal ne farmaya: Jab Main use us ki do mehboob cheezon me aazmata hun yani us ki dono aankhen phir woh sabr karta hai to Main use Jannat ata karke badla deta hun."
"535","Khattab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Sabit bin Ajlan aur Ishaq bin Yazid se, dono ne kaha: Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sabit ne mujh se bayan kiya, Qasim se, woh Hazrat Abu Umama se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Allah farmata hai: Ae Ibn Adam jab Main teri do qeemti cheezen le lun phir tu pehli chot par sabr kare aur sawab ki umeed rakhe to Main tere liye Jannat se kam sawab par raazi na hunga."
"536","Ahmad bin Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne mujhe khabar di, Abd Rabbihi bin Saeed se, unhon ne kaha: Minhal bin Amr ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Haris se, woh Hazrat Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab mareez ki ayadat karte to us ke sar ke paas baithte phir saat martaba kehte: Main Allah Azeem se jo Arsh Azeem ka Rab hai sawal karta hun ke woh tujhe shifa de, phir agar us ki ajal me muhlat hoti to woh apne dard se afaqa pa leta."
"537","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rabi bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Hasan ke sath Qatada ke paas us ki ayadat ke liye gaya to woh us ke sar ke paas baithe phir us se haal pucha phir us ke liye dua ki, unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah us ke dil ko shifa de aur us ke marz ko shifa de."
"538","Abdullah bin Raja aur Hafs bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Hakam se, woh Ibrahim se, woh Aswad se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se pucha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne ghar walon me kya karte the, to unhon ne kaha: Woh apne ghar walon ki khidmat me hote the phir jab namaz ka waqt ata to bahar nikal jate."
"539","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mahdi bin Maimun ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwa se, woh apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se pucha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne ghar me kya kaam karte the, unhon ne kaha: Apni juti ganthe the aur woh kaam karte the jo mard apne ghar me karta hai."
